          <div class="sc-jrQzAO gACUHK pf-icon-left" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion">
           <div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-kDTinF cmxFnd">
            <button type="button" class="sc-furwcr bQmZNl pf-anchor" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-plus pfa-arrow"></i><span data-text-editing="true" class="">Can I have my order shipped via UPS to a P.O. Box?</span></button>
            <div data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-pVTFL hKxRej" style="display: none;">
             <div class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-r pf-r-eh" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Row" style="--s-xs: 15px; --s-lg: 0px;">
              <div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs: 12; --c-md: 12; --c-lg: 12;">
               <div draggable="true" data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bilyIR egurxi">
                <p class="sc-jQrDum eEXLPW pf-text-1 pf-caret-color-transparent pf-word-wrap-break-word" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We provide shipping via UPS and they will only accept shipments to a valid street address. UPS does not deliver to P.O. Boxes. Your shipping request addressed to a P.O. Box will be delayed and will require an address correction before shipment. Additionally, Army Post Office (APO) and Fleet Post Office (FPO) addresses are not accepted. Contact our Coffee Experts to learn more or call our Coffee Hotline at 1-2345-6789.</p>
