            <div data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-pVTFL hKxRej" style="display: none;">
             <div class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-r pf-r-eh" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Row" style="--s-xs: 15px; --s-lg: 0px;">
              <div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs: 12; --c-md: 12; --c-lg: 12;">
               <div draggable="true" data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-bilyIR egurxi">
                <p class="sc-jQrDum eEXLPW pf-text-1 pf-caret-color-transparent pf-word-wrap-break-word" contenteditable="true" spellcheck="false" draggable="true" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Coffee is a perishable product, so we DO NOT accept any coffee returns (unless a Coffee Expert specifically requests a return in writing). However, if an error was made, you are not happy with the coffee, or you received a damaged product, please contact us so we can make it right. All shipping charges are non-refundable, and the Refund Policy does not extend beyond the 14-day window.</p>
               </div>
              </div>
             </div>
